OL,3,ALaundry rooms to be turned into cells
OL,4,Ato tackle prison overcrowding
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told the BBC prisoners being
OL,7,Freleased early did not mean "freedom"
OL,8,Ffor them and victims would have a say
OL,9,Fin restrictions placed on those
OL,10,Fcriminals.
